id=MirageVerboseBoot
name=Mirage Verbose Boot + Anti-Bootloop
version=v1.1.2
versionCode=4
author=Mor4land
description=Arch Linux style real-time kernel (/dev/kmsg) + Android init + system boot logger via SurfaceFlinger BLAST overlay. Auto-detects bootloops, disables offending Magisk modules, and saves full crash logs to /sdcard/Download/MirageBootloop_LAST.log.
